     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t<span></span>\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">\r\nDear ctmm community,</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">The\r\nEcological Informatics Lab in the Department of Biology at the\r\nUniversity of Central Florida (UCF) in Orlando, Florida, USA is\r\nrecruiting masters and PhD students to conduct research at the\r\ninterface of animal movement, statistics, and conservation under the\r\nadvise of <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=NRKu67IAAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?user%3DNRKu67IAAAAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3syhj-ow8qzpm7AcXTobkc\">Dr.\r\nChristen H. Fleming</a>. Potential research topics include: corridor\r\nestimation, disease transmission, habitat suitability, and behavioral\r\ninference. Students will have the opportunity to advance the\r\nopen-source <a href=\"https://biology.umd.edu/movement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://biology.umd.edu/movement&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NjnZ4aetgE5KRRDQLrS20\">&quot;continuous-time\r\nmovement modeling&quot; (ctmm) R project</a>, work closely with the\r\nUCF <a href=\"https://sciences.ucf.edu/biology/marineturtleresearchgroup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sciences.ucf.edu/biology/marineturtleresearchgroup/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yrvPXHm-9jWOC9wDNAlSW\">Marine\r\nTurtle Research Group</a>, and collaborate productively with ctmm\r\nassociated groups at <a href=\"https://www.casus.science/research/earth-systems-science/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.casus.science/research/earth-systems-science/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Zcqt0VxBbcDTJKz7fjB0A\">CASUS</a>,\r\n<a href=\"https://science.umd.edu/biology/faganlab/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://science.umd.edu/biology/faganlab/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ql2fBe2JP8eDu9V7hiH9F\">UMD</a>, <a href=\"https://noonanm.github.io/QuantitativeEcologyLab/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://noonanm.github.io/QuantitativeEcologyLab/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pljy__uhgtutdEnim8T5e\">UBC</a>,\r\nand <a href=\"http://www.jmalston.com/research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.jmalston.com/research&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-4NIl4Nu_Y5EzVOnlvqQR\">UA</a>.</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">The\r\ndeadline for <a href=\"https://applynow.graduate.ucf.edu/apply/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://applynow.graduate.ucf.edu/apply/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bkIxY_hSTN7F29-5rIwmx\">applications</a>\r\nis December <span></span>1st. A number of <a href=\"https://graduate.ucf.edu/fellowships/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://graduate.ucf.edu/fellowships/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DzdqfYh7gdR_S7gHmurfv\">fellowships</a>\r\nare available, and will be met with matching funds. Please contact\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">christen...@ucf.edu</a>\r\nbefore applying—acceptance requires a consenting dissertation\r\nadvisor.</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">Christen H. Fleming</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">Assistant Professor</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  The University of\r\nCentral Florida</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  Department of\r\nBiology</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  4110 Libra Drive</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  Orlando, Florida\r\n32816-2368</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">christen...@ucf.edu</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  <a href=\"https://biology.umd.edu/movement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://biology.umd.edu/movement&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NjnZ4aetgE5KRRDQLrS20\">https://biology.umd.edu/movement</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">Research Associate</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  Smithsonian\r\nConservation Biology Institute</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  Conservation\r\nEcology Center</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  Front Royal,\r\nVirginia 22630</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">flem...@si.edu</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:100%;margin-bottom:0in\">  <a href=\"https://movementoflife.si.edu/analytical-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://movementoflife.si.edu/analytical-tools&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792455726657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZaY17VgNiMei1NeEdvark\">https://movementoflife.si.edu/analytical-tools</a></p>\r\n\r\n"
